<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Apr 03 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Apr 03 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $667.80 million in the week to April 03 from $1.137 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     31.59		63.69</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     13.73		29.62</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  636.21	    1073.76</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    168.81	     230.12</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	488.06	     833.25</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    179.74	     304.19</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
